description:
At first I thought this was bobcat scat because of the segments and size. But later down the trail I saw lots of similar scat along with wild boar tracks.

At this site, there were several piles of scat, similar to a coyote latrine.

@beartracker, can you tell the difference between bobcat & boar scat?

I think the toes of the hind foot landed right on the pad of the front track and the hind foot pad didn't register.

@jim_carretta
@beartracker
